Thylacine DX-1: gate the BIOS boot-logo PNG decode behind C_LIBPNG.
bios.cpp decodes an embedded DOSBox logo PNG (BIOSLOGO_PNG_READ + a
self-contained block) via libpng UNCONDITIONALLY -- upstream assumes
libpng is always present. DX-1 builds without libpng (logo + screenshots
are DX-3), so gate both regions; the ASCII text logo fallback remains.

